 				<h3 epub:type="z3998:ordinal z3998:roman">XXXI</h3>
 				<p epub:type="title">Our Foreign Correspondent</p>
 			</hgroup>
-			<blockquote>
+			<blockquote epub:type="z3998:letter">
 				<p epub:type="se:letter.dateline">“London.</p>
 				<p epub:type="z3998:salutation">“Dearest People⁠—</p>
 				<p>“Here I really sit at a front window of the Bath Hotel, Piccadilly. It’s not a fashionable place, but uncle stopped here years ago, and won’t go anywhere else; however, we don’t mean to stay long, so it’s no great matter. Oh, I can’t begin to tell you how I enjoy it all! I never can, so I’ll only give you bits out of my notebook, for I’ve done nothing but sketch and scribble since I started.</p>
